{{wikipedia}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|anatomy}} Either of the tenth pair of [[cranial nerve]]s, which extends from the [[brainstem]] down into the [[abdomen]]. Branches of these important nerves supply the [[tongue]], [[larynx]], [[lung]]s, [[gut]], and [[heart]].

====Synonyms====
* {{l|en|nervus vagus}}
* {{l|en|pneumogastric nerve}}
* {{l|en|tenth cranial nerve}}
* {{l|en|wandering nerve}}

